# Allowlist: o contexto e a raiz do repositorio (que inclui material de pesquisa local de varios GB).
# Tudo e ignorado, exceto o necessario para o build do web.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/web/
!infra/docker/nginx/
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/dist/
apps/web/artifacts/
apps/web/.data/
apps/web/.env
apps/web/.env.*
!apps/web/.env.example
